/29_38/01_dictionary.md:92:## ص د د (root_000848) — identity root of فَصَدَّهُمْ (w12)\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/01_dictionary.md:110:## س ب ل (root_000672) — identity root of ٱلسَّبِيلِ (w14)\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/01_dictionary.md:136:## ب ص ر (root_000121) — identity root of مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ (w16)\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:14:  - 29:38 w16 **مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ** (ب ص ر B002: iç kavrayış / بصيرة القلب) — The branch image of heart-sight supplies active inward discernment and makes the cognition-conduct split explicit.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:24:  - 29:38 w11 **أَعْمَٰلَهُمْ** (ع م ل B001: bilerek yapılan iş veya eylem / الفعل المقصود والعمل) — The branch image of purposive action makes their own intentional conduct the medium of capture.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:25:  - 29:38 w12 **فَصَدَّهُمْ** (ص د د B001: yüz çevirme ve alıkoyma / إعراض وصرف) — The branch image of turning away and turning another supplies the resulting redirection.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:26:  - 29:38 w14 **ٱلسَّبِيلِ** (س ب ل B001: yol ve bir amaca ulaştıran yol / طريق ممتد يسلك) — The branch image of an extended traversable road supplies the course from which action is redirected.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:42:- mechanism: The opening sequence tests professed security by separating truthful claim from evil work and faulty judgment. Applied to مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ, insight is equipment under assay; beautification causes failure at the transfer from judgment to action.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:44:  - 29:38 w16 **مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ** (ب ص ر B002: iç kavrayış / بصيرة القلب) — Heart-sight supplies the cognitive capacity whose practical force is being tested.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:56:  - 29:38 w12 **فَصَدَّهُمْ** (ص د د B001: yüz çevirme ve alıkoyma / إعراض وصرف) — Turning another away supplies the focus ayah's blocked movement that the rival invitation operationalizes.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:58:  - 29:12 w7 **سَبِيلَنَا** (س ب ل B001: yol ve bir amaca ulaştıran yol / طريق ممتد يسلك) — The extended traversable road supplies an explicit competing path rather than mere aimlessness.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:69:  - 29:38 w11 **أَعْمَٰلَهُمْ** (ع م ل B001: bilerek yapılan iş veya eylem / الفعل المقصود والعمل) — Purposive deeds supply the repeated conduct through which the shared valuation becomes social fact.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:119:  - 29:38 w11 **أَعْمَٰلَهُمْ** (ع م ل B001: bilerek yapılan iş veya eylem / الفعل المقصود والعمل) — Purposive action supplies the behavioral level at which attraction and inhibition compete.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:126:- before: مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ is ironic because genuinely discerning people could not be diverted.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:130:  - 29:38 w16 **مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ** (ب ص ر B002: iç kavrayış / بصيرة القلب) — Heart-sight supplies real inward discernment rather than a necessarily sarcastic label.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:131:  - 29:38 w12 **فَصَدَّهُمْ** (ص د د B001: yüz çevirme ve alıkoyma / إعراض وصرف) — Turning away supplies the behavioral result that real cognition fails to prevent.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:160:  - 29:38 w16 **مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ** (ب ص ر B002: iç kavrayış / بصيرة القلب) — Heart-sight supplies the focus capacity whose trust-allocation is at issue.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:172:  - 29:38 w12 **فَصَدَّهُمْ** (ص د د B001: yüz çevirme ve alıkoyma / إعراض وصرف) — Turning away supplies the failed motion that the closing counter-sequence reverses.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:173:  - 29:38 w14 **ٱلسَّبِيلِ** (س ب ل B001: yol ve bir amaca ulaştıran yol / طريق ممتد يسلك) — The extended traversable route supplies the singular blocked course.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:183:- containment: This is surprising because it uses the peripheral س ب ل branch of an eye-film resembling woven webbing, not the ordinary road sense. It remains anchored because the focus itself joins سَبِيل to مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ and 29:41 supplies an actual weaving spider and a weak structure. Downstream prose should mark it only as an exploratory material analogy, never as a lexical translation of ٱلسَّبِيل.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:185:  - 29:38 w14 **ٱلسَّبِيلِ** (س ب ل B010: kırmızı damarlı ağsı göz perdesi / غشاوة في العين تشبه النسج) — The branch image of an eye-film like spider web supplies a thin visual obstruction latent beside the ordinary path branch.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:186:  - 29:38 w16 **مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ** (ب ص ر B001: gözle görme / إبصار العين) — The branch image of ocular sight keeps the material analogy anchored in the focus's own vision construction.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/02_hft.md:204:- remaining_uncertainties: مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ may denote moral discernment, worldly acumen, or both; the trace does not force one.\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/03_pairs.md:10:  - same: ص د د B001 yüz çevirme ve alıkoyma / إعراض وصرف ← 29:38 فَصَدَّهُمْ\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/03_pairs.md:28:  - same: ع م ل B007 zahmete girmek / التعمل بمعنى التعني ← 29:38 أَعْمَٰلَهُمْ\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/03_pairs.md:37:  - same: ع م ل B008 işe yatkın ve dayanıklı / المطبوع على العمل ← 29:38 أَعْمَٰلَهُمْ\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/03_pairs.md:38:  - same: ب ص ر B002 iç kavrayış / بصيرة القلب ← 29:38 مُسْتَبْصِرِينَ\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/03_pairs.md:46:  - same: ع م ل B005 karşılıklı işlem / المعاملة بين الناس ← 29:38 أَعْمَٰلَهُمْ\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/03_pairs.md:47:  - same: س ب ل B002 yol kullanan kişi veya yolcu / أهل الطريق وسالكوه ← 29:38 ٱلسَّبِيلِ\n_commentary/v9/input/v2/s029/29_38/03_pairs.md:55:  - same: س ب ل B001 yol ve bir amaca ulaşt